WEBVTT

00:01:29.636 --> 00:01:31.876
A national park in the sea.

00:01:33.756 --> 00:01:35.716
We surveyed the marine environment then,

00:01:35.716 --> 00:01:37.876
and the place was an underwater desert.

00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:41.236
When we returned a decade later,

00:01:41.236 --> 00:01:42.916
everything had changed.

00:01:44.036 --> 00:01:48.956
What had been a barren sea
was now a kaleidoscope of life and color.

00:01:49.716 --> 00:01:52.796
We saw it come back to pristine
in only 10 years,

00:01:52.836 --> 00:01:57.236
including the return of the large fish
like groupers, jacks and sharks.